  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. This is the initial release for AWS Elemental MediaConnect, an ingest and transport service for live video. This new AWS service allows broadcasters and content owners to send high-value live content into the cloud, securely transmit it to partners for distribution, and replicate it to multiple destinations around the globe.",
